  "title": "Carrot Sheet Cake",
  "description": "If you love carrot cake, try this family recipe for carrot sheet cake - complete with pineapple, walnuts, coconut, and of course, homemade cream cheese frosting.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
